    "type": "question",
    "label": "3",
    "prompt": "Radioactive decay is a physical phenomenon that can be modelled using an exponential relationship. A piece of radioactive material decays according to the equation $m = 800(0.95)^t$, where $m$ is the mass of radioactive substance in grams and $t$ is the number of years.",
